  "id": "intuitive-judgment",
  "term": "intuitive judgment",
  "definition": "Intuitive judgment is a fast, immediate way of evaluating options or making choices with little deliberation. In this source, it refers to the kind of quick response that algorithmically curated digital cues can more easily guide than slower, more reflective decision-making.",
